  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kokuro Livestock Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Livestock.Beneficiaries: Livestock traders.Summary: The project funds will be used to improve the group&apos;s capacity to market its members&apos; livestock by improving the sale yard infrastructure; including installing water storage; an office and latrines. Funding will also be used to train LMA members and staff in animal health; entrepreneurship; and financial management; and fund an exposure visit in which members will visit another successful LMA and seek markets for their animals.</narrative>
  </description>
